   "intro": "The Flyer 7 SPACEdeck is conspicuously sporty and energetic.\nYou have a choice of two versions of upholstery: Standard or Elegance with stainless steel pulpits or black pulpits.\nThe console has a wraparound windshield and hand rails which make movements on the two symmetrical side decks much safer.",
