   "items": [
    {
     "title": "Driving sensations",
     "text": "The Flyer 7 has the Air Step® 2 hull, which means that it lifts off fast and is much more stable even at full speed."
    },
    {
     "title": "TRAILABLE",
     "text": "Extremely spacious and practical, another important feature of the Flyer 7 SUNdeck is its trailability."
    },
    {
     "title": "Cockpit",
     "text": "The cockpit saloon is surprisingly large.\nIt seats up to 6 people, thanks to the rotating bolster seats and the built-in side bench seats."
    }
